":"2011-04-18"},"source_ladder_exhausted_proposed":[],"status":"MACHINE DRAFT - UNVERIFIED; not a claim; see jobs/claim-drafts/AGENT_GUIDE.md"},"claim":{"instrument_id":"EO:13570","later_source_search":[],"operative_clauses":[{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Section 1. Except to the extent provided in statutes or in licenses, regulations, \norders, or directives that may be issued pursuant to this order, and notwith-\nstanding any contract entered into or any license or permit granted prior \nto the date of this order, the importation into the United States, directly \nor indirectly, of any goods, services, or technology from North Korea is \nprohibited.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"76 FR 22291, PDF pages 1-2; Sec. 1","sha256":"8ac7053a3b8bd76e66c56dadfdde4cf6d549d6012d9fd26bd97ad7a1da9f74d0","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2011-04-20/pdf/2011-9739.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13570#sec1","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(a) Any transaction by a United States person or within the United \nStates that evades or avoids, has the purpose of evading or avoiding, causes \na violation of, or attempts to violate any of the prohibitions set forth in \nthis order is prohibited.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"76 FR 22291, PDF pages 1-2; Sec. 2(a)","sha256":"8ac7053a3b8bd76e66c56dadfdde4cf6d549d6012d9fd26bd97ad7a1da9f74d0","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2011-04-20/pdf/2011-9739.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13570#sec2(a)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(b) Any conspiracy formed to violate any of the prohibitions set forth \nin this order is prohibited.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"76 FR 22291, PDF pages 1-2; Sec. 2(b)","sha256":"8ac7053a3b8bd76e66c56dadfdde4cf6d549d6012d9fd26bd97ad7a1da9f74d0","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2011-04-20/pdf/2011-9739.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13570#sec2(b)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Sec. 3. The provisions of Executive Orders 13466 and 13551 remain in \neffect, and this order does not affect any action taken pursuant to those \norders.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"76 FR 22291, PDF pages 1-2; Sec. 3","sha256":"8ac7053a3b8bd76e66c56dadfdde4cf6d549d6012d9fd26bd97ad7a1da9f74d0","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2011-04-20/pdf/2011-9739.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13570#sec3","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Sec. 4. For the purposes of this order:","original_source":{"page_or_item":"76 FR 22291, PDF pages 1-2; Sec. 4 (lead-in)","sha256":"8ac7053a3b8bd76e66c56dadfdde4cf6d549d6012d9fd26bd97ad7a1da9f74d0","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2011-04-20/pdf/2011-9739.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13570#sec4","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(a) the term ‘‘person’’ means an individual or entity;","original_source":{"page_or_item":"76 FR 22291, PDF pages 1-2; Sec. 4(a)","sha256":"8ac7053a3b8bd76e66c56dadfdde4cf6d549d6012d9fd26bd97ad7a1da9f74d0","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2011-04-20/pdf/2011-9739.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13570#sec4(a)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(b) the term ‘‘entity’’ means a partnership, association, trust, joint venture, \ncorporation, group, subgroup, or other organization;","original_source":{"page_or_item":"76 FR 22291, PDF pages 1-2; Sec. 4(b)","sha256":"8ac7053a3b8bd76e66c56dadfdde4cf6d549d6012d9fd26bd97ad7a1da9f74d0","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2011-04-20/pdf/2011-9739.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13570#sec4(b)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(c) the term ‘‘United States person ’’ means any United States citizen, \npermanent resident alien, entity organized under the laws of the United \nStates or any jurisdiction within the United States (including foreign \nbranches), or any person in the United States;","original_source":{"page_or_item":"76 FR 22291, PDF pages 1-2; Sec. 4(c)","sha256":"8ac7053a3b8bd76e66c56dadfdde4cf6d549d6012d9fd26bd97ad7a1da9f74d0","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2011-04-20/pdf/2011-9739.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13570#sec4(c)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(d) the term ‘‘North Korea’’ includes the territory of the Democratic People’s \nRepublic of Korea and the Government of North Korea; and","original_source":{"page_or_item":"76 FR 22291, PDF pages 1-2; Sec. 4(d)","sha256":"8ac7053a3b8bd76e66c56dadfdde4cf6d549d6012d9fd26bd97ad7a1da9f74d0","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2011-04-20/pdf/2011-9739.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13570#sec4(d)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"(e) the term ‘‘Government of North Korea ’’ means the Government of the \nDemocratic People’s Republic of Korea, its agencies, instrumentalities, and \ncontrolled entities.","original_source":{"page_or_item":"76 FR 22291, PDF pages 1-2; Sec. 4(e)","sha256":"8ac7053a3b8bd76e66c56dadfdde4cf6d549d6012d9fd26bd97ad7a1da9f74d0","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2011-04-20/pdf/2011-9739.pdf"},"scope_id":"EO:13570#sec4(e)","state_at_cutoff":null},{"current_predicate":null,"first_end":null,"later_events":[],"original_operative_text":"Sec. 5. The Secretary of the Treasury, in consultation with the Secretary \nof State, is hereby authorized to take such actions, including the promulgation \nof rules and regulations, and to employ all powers granted to the President \nVerDate Mar<15>2010 18:34 Apr 19, 20